# Whitelist-style: ignore everything, then re-admit exactly what the runner
# needs. Safer than blacklisting, because the parent workspace next door holds
# 4.25 GiB of firmware images and analysis reports that contain the device SN,
# MAC addresses and sensor calibration values. Nothing should reach this repo by
# accident.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!surgery.sh
!bimg.py
!removelist.txt
!app/
!app/EClassSettingsStub.apk
!skel/
!skel/*.skel.bimg

# Never, under any circumstances:
work/
out/
*.img
*.log
*.pristine.img
